{"seq":1,"slug":"calculus-and-fluxions","title":"微积分与流数法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/mathematics-and-optics/calculus-and-fluxions","wordCount":1674,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"微积分与流数法\">微积分与流数法</h1><p>在物理学之外，牛顿留给世界最深远的数学遗产，是微积分。他在 1665—1666 年的&quot;奇迹年&quot;间发展出这套方法，称之为&quot;流数法&quot;。微积分回答了一个古老而棘手的问题：如何精确处理&quot;瞬时变化&quot;和&quot;曲线下的面积&quot;这类涉及无穷小量的对象？它后来成为整个现代科学与工程的通用语言。牛顿的物理学之所以能写成数学定律，正是因为他手里握着这件别人尚未掌握的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微积分由两个互逆的运算构成：微分（求变化率）与积分（求累积量）。牛顿的独特之处在于他从&quot;运动&quot;的直观出发——把变量想象成随时间连续&quot;流动&quot;的量（他称为 <em>fluent</em>，流量），把它的变化率称为 <em>fluxion</em>（流数）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;流量 fluent · 随时间流动的变量 x&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;流数 fluxion · 变化率 ẋ&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;微分 · 求瞬时变化率&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;积分 · 求累积量 / 面积&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;微积分基本定理 · 二者互逆&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;描述运动 · 轨道 · 速度 · 加速度&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"流量 fluent · 随时间流动的变量 x\"] --&gt; B[\"流数 fluxion · 变化率 ẋ\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"微分 · 求瞬时变化率\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"积分 · 求累积量 / 面积\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"微积分基本定理 · 二者互逆\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[\"描述运动 · 轨道 · 速度 · 加速度\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>牛顿术语</th>\n<th>现代术语</th>\n<th>直观含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流动的量</td>\n<td>fluent（流量）</td>\n<td>变量 / 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>随时间变化的量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变化率</td>\n<td>fluxion（流数）</td>\n<td>导数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x}=dx/dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>瞬时速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无穷小增量</td>\n<td>moment（瞬）</td>\n<td>微分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极短时间内的微小变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积</td>\n<td>求流量</td>\n<td>积分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int x\\,dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>面积 / 总量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流数法的核心思想\">流数法的核心思想</h2><p>牛顿的进路深植于运动学直觉。他设想几何图形是由点的连续运动&quot;画&quot;出来的：一条曲线是动点的轨迹，一块面积是一条线扫过的结果。既然这些量随时间连续变化，就可以谈论它们在每一瞬间的&quot;流动速度&quot;——这正是流数。</p>\n<p>例如，若某物体的位置随时间变化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则它的速度（一阶流数）是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x}=\\frac{dx}{dt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加速度（二阶流数）是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{x}=\\frac{d^2x}{dt^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>牛顿用头顶加点的记号表示流数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ddot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），这套&quot;点记号&quot;今天在物理学中仍用于表示对时间的导数。求曲线下面积、求切线斜率、求极值，这些原本各自独立的难题，在流数法中被统一为微分与积分两类互逆运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微积分基本定理\">微积分基本定理</h2><p>微积分最深刻的洞见，是微分与积分互为逆运算——这就是微积分基本定理。直观地说：如果先把一个量累积起来（积分），再求它的变化率（微分），就回到了原来的量。用现代记号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3262em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>牛顿与莱布尼茨各自独立地认识到了这一定理的普遍性和威力。在他们之前，求切线和求面积被当作两类毫不相干的几何问题，许多前辈（费马、巴罗、卡瓦列里等）已得到零散结果；正是基本定理把它们焊接成一门统一的、可机械操作的方法论，这才是&quot;发明微积分&quot;的真正含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"牛顿的进路与符号的局限\">牛顿的进路与符号的局限</h2><p>牛顿虽然发明早，但在符号与传播上却处于劣势。他的&quot;点记号&quot;擅长表达对时间的导数，却不便于表示一般函数对任意变量的求导，更没有简洁的积分符号。相比之下，莱布尼茨独立发展的记号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{dy}{dx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mo>∫</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\displaystyle\\int y\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 直观、灵活、易于推广，把微分和积分的互逆关系直接写在了符号形式里。</p>\n<p>这一符号差异影响深远。欧洲大陆数学家普遍采用莱布尼茨记号，分析学因此在 18 世纪迅猛发展；而英国数学界出于民族情绪固守牛顿记号，反而在此后一个多世纪相对落后，直到 19 世纪初才转用大陆记法。这段历史说明：一个好的符号系统本身就是重要的科学生产力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何是-重新发明-而非-发现\">为何是&quot;重新发明&quot;而非&quot;发现&quot;</h2><p>一个常见误解，是把微积分理解为某天被&quot;发现&quot;的现成真理。更准确的理解是：微积分的核心思想——无穷小量、变化率、累积——在牛顿之前已有大量零散的先驱工作。牛顿与莱布尼茨的贡献，是把它组织成一套可机械操作、可普遍应用的方法论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>先驱</th>\n<th>已得到的结果</th>\n<th>缺失的环节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阿基米德</td>\n<td>求抛物线下的面积</td>\n<td>无一般方法，靠特例技巧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡瓦列里</td>\n<td>不可分量（无穷小）的直观</td>\n<td>缺乏严格性与互逆关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费马</td>\n<td>求极值、切线的方法</td>\n<td>未与求面积统一起来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴罗（导师）</td>\n<td>切线与面积互逆的雏形</td>\n<td>未提炼为通用定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>牛顿</td>\n<td>流数法 + 基本定理</td>\n<td>符号不便推广</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因如此，史学界更愿意把微积分说成&quot;被创造&quot;（invented）而非&quot;被发现&quot;。牛顿的独到之处在于他把这套工具与物理运动直接绑定，使其立刻成为描述自然的有力武器，而不只是几何技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"牛顿为何迟迟不发表\">牛顿为何迟迟不发表</h2><p>一个常被追问的问题是：牛顿既然 1666 年前后就掌握了流数法，为何迟迟不正式发表，以致后来陷入优先权之争？原因有几方面。其一，牛顿生性谨慎甚至多疑，早年因光学论文遭胡克等人批评而对公开发表心存戒备。其二，流数法对他主要是私人工具，他更愿在成果成熟后才示人。其三，在《原理》中，牛顿出于让同代人易于接受的考虑，大量采用传统的几何证明而非新发明的分析方法，使得他的微积分功底反而被&quot;藏&quot;了起来。</p>\n<p>这种迟疑的代价，是莱布尼茨于 1684 年率先发表了微分法、1686 年发表积分法，从而在&quot;出版优先权&quot;上占了先机，为日后那场旷日持久的争论埋下伏笔（详见本库第三章）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>牛顿在 1665—1666 年&quot;奇迹年&quot;间发展出微积分，称之为&quot;流数法&quot;。</li>\n<li>他从运动学直觉出发：把变量看作&quot;流动的量&quot;（流量），把变化率称为流数，用点记号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示。</li>\n<li>微积分基本定理揭示微分与积分互逆，这是&quot;发明微积分&quot;的真正核心。</li>\n<li>牛顿的点记号不及莱布尼茨的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dy/dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int y\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 灵活，导致英国数学界长期落后。</li>\n<li>牛顿因生性谨慎而迟迟不发表，使莱布尼茨在出版优先权上占先，埋下争议伏笔。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"微积分与流数法","id":"微积分与流数法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流数法的核心思想","id":"流数法的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"微积分基本定理","id":"微积分基本定理"},{"level":2,"text":"牛顿的进路与符号的局限","id":"牛顿的进路与符号的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"为何是\"重新发明\"而非\"发现\"","id":"为何是-重新发明-而非-发现"},{"level":2,"text":"牛顿为何迟迟不发表","id":"牛顿为何迟迟不发表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"《原理》与天体力学的重建","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/classical-mechanics/principia-and-celestial-mechanics"},"next":{"title":"光学与颜色理论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/core-contributions/mathematics-and-optics/optics-and-theory-of-color"}}